{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Let us work through a hydroelectric energy-transfer example. Water in a high reservoir has a gravitational potential energy store. As it descends, this store decreases and the kinetic energy of the flowing water increases. The moving water does mechanical work on a turbine, and the generator transfers energy electrically to the grid. Some energy is dissipated to the surroundings because of friction and other losses.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 27.167347, "words": [["Let", 0.0], ["us", 0.279], ["work", 0.488], ["through", 0.871], ["a", 1.3], ["hydroelectric", 1.463], ["energy-transfer", 2.357], ["example.", 3.309], ["Water", 4.075], ["in", 4.54], ["a", 4.702], ["high", 4.818], ["reservoir", 5.12], ["has", 5.77], ["a", 6.014], ["gravitational", 6.118], ["potential", 7.024], ["energy", 7.663], ["store.", 8.069], ["As", 8.754], ["it", 8.986], ["descends,", 9.125], ["this", 9.776], ["store", 9.985], ["decreases", 10.333], ["and", 11.134], ["the", 11.401], ["kinetic", 11.529], ["energy", 12.098], ["of", 12.55], ["the", 12.701], ["flowing", 12.841], ["water", 13.317], ["increases.", 13.769], ["The", 14.733], ["moving", 14.942], ["water", 15.337], ["does", 15.732], ["mechanical", 16.045], ["work", 16.719], ["on", 17.032], ["a", 17.16], ["turbine,", 17.241], ["and", 17.938], ["the", 18.158], ["generator", 18.298], ["transfers", 18.878], ["energy", 19.563], ["electrically", 20.144], ["to", 20.922], ["the", 21.119], ["grid.", 21.235], ["Some", 22.048], ["energy", 22.408], ["is", 22.942], ["dissipated", 23.104], ["to", 23.754], ["the", 23.917], ["surroundings", 24.033], ["because", 24.741], ["of", 25.194], ["friction", 25.299], ["and", 25.833], ["other", 26.007], ["losses.", 26.367]], "raw": [{"text": "Let", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.209}, {"text": "us", "start": 0.279, "end": 0.406}, {"text": "work", "start": 0.488, "end": 0.801}, {"text": "through", "start": 0.871, "end": 1.242}, {"text": "a",